The gitops service (services/gitops) embeds the GitOps engine of Argo CD
as a Go module dependency, not a copy:

  Argo CD gitops-engine
  github.com/argoproj/argo-cd/gitops-engine
  at the commit of the Argo CD v3.5.6 release (c2b1e3017e2c)
  Copyright 2017-2018 The Argo Authors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  https://github.com/argoproj/argo-cd

Its cluster cache, diffing, sync (phases, waves, hooks, pruning) and
health assessment are Argo CD's. The application-level behaviour around
the engine in services/gitops/internal (rendering, comparison, automated
sync and self-heal decisions, Secret masking) follows Argo CD's
repo-server and application controller and is SDI's own code.

The gitops service also uses, as module dependencies under the Apache
License, Version 2.0: Kubernetes client libraries (k8s.io), Kustomize
(sigs.k8s.io/kustomize) and Helm (helm.sh/helm/v3).
